From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bump hono, undici, node-forge and papaparse for CVEs

Bumps vendored hono 4.13.13 -> 4.13.16 (CVE-2026-126356, CVE-2026-126355,
CVE-2026-126357, CVE-2026-126358, CVE-2026-126359), undici 7.30.1 ->
7.30.2 (CVE-2026-120415, CVE-2026-120474, CVE-2026-120423, CVE-2026-120222,
CVE-2026-116630), node-forge 1.4.0 -> 1.4.3 (CVE-2026-125334,
CVE-2026-125336) and papaparse 5.5.3 -> 5.7.1 (CVE-2026-127056).

Upstream: https://github.com/honojs/hono/releases/tag/v4.13.16
Upstream: https://github.com/nodejs/undici/releases/tag/v7.30.2
Upstream: https://github.com/digitalbazaar/forge/releases/tag/v1.4.3
Upstream: https://github.com/mholt/PapaParse/releases/tag/5.7.1

Generated against the post-uuid-11.1.0 lockfile (all earlier frontend
patches applied), so this comes last.

